Walkbook is a text-to-speech reader that lets you listen to PDF, EPUB, and web pages. It's created to help users save time, be more productive, and assist reading.

HOW IT WORKS:
Step 1: Import a document to Walkbook, and the app will automatically extract text from the document;
Step 2: You can then let Walkbook read the doc in a natural voice, just like listening to podcasts or audiobooks.

PRICING:
- The app comes with 10 minutes of free trial listening time.
- You can unlock unlimited listening time with a weekly or monthly subscription plan.

FEATURES:
- Listen to PDF, ebooks, and web pages with an AI-powered natural voice;
- Import from Google Drive and Dropbox;
- Send a web link to the app via iOS Share Sheet;
- Extract clean, fluent text with powerful text extraction.
